abstract: >
  Offline software for imitation learning (ACT), language-conditioned VLA
  conversion (SmolVLA), human-gated DAgger fine-tuning, hybrid metric-depth
  grasp control, and protocol-based success metrics on SO-101 manipulation.
  Companion hardware stack: SO101_Visuomotor_Manipulation.
